<h1>The best Wanderhotels <br><strong>in the Eisacktal</strong></h1>
<p>Between Brenner and Bolzano, the Eisacktal tells tales of kings, emperors, and traveling merchants who once sought rest here. Today, it is <strong>quiet side valleys</strong> and <strong>charming villages</strong> that enchant <strong>nature lovers</strong> with their <strong>unspoiled character</strong> – whether in the wildly romantic Ridnauntal, the idyllic Lüsental, or the sporty Eggental. Everywhere, trails of varying difficulty invite you to enjoy an extensive hiking vacation in the Eisacktal. <strong>Genuine warmth</strong> is promised by the traditional alpine huts and the family-run <a title="Hiking hotels in South Tyrol" href="/en/south-tyrol">Wanderhotels in South Tyrol.</a></p>
<p>Those who hike in the Eisacktal will experience authenticity and find exactly what is often missing in everyday life: peace, freedom, and a sense of security.</p>
